### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health


### Get all assets from MongoDB
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets


### Get one asset
# Replace the ID below with an actual ID returned by GET /api/assets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID


### Get missing asset
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets/000000000000000000000000


### Create a valid asset
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "TAB-2026-001",
  "name": "Samsung Galaxy Tab",
  "category": "Tablet",
  "serialNumber": "SN-TAB-001",
  "location": "HQ Level 4"
}


### Create an invalid asset
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "",
  "name": "",
  "category": "",
  "serialNumber": "",
  "location": ""
}


### Get all tickets from MongoDB
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets


### Get one ticket
# Replace the ID below with an actual ID returned by GET /api/tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID


### Get missing ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000


### Create a valid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot access email",
  "description": "User cannot login to company email account.",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "amir@example.com"
}


### Create an invalid ticket (missing title)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Missing title",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "createdBy": "test@example.com"
}
